                                                "example_id": "f8be76ed-ce18-40b6-a3cb-297251165ad9",
                                                "sense_id": "aa808234-dc2f-3826-ab86-fe986ef4ec9d",
                                                "text": "She has a lighter and more coloratura voice."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f352395c-16d2-43b6-a0c8-b3eda48fc4a7",
                                                "sense_id": "aa808234-dc2f-3826-ab86-fe986ef4ec9d",
                                                "text": "I drew a deep breath, this time fortunately unmixed with gin and tonic. I was profoundly stirred. “You mean,” I said, my voice quavering like that of a coloratura soprano, “that I went through that soul-shattering experience all for nothing?”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
